  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1fd3ad36a524e1346b4a312a275456a0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  npcName: Brother Cael
  dialogueRole: 1
  defaultLines: []
  questData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f31a9492d18fe004092df2e89dae430d, type: 2}
  beforeQuestLines:
  - You hear them too, don't you? The stones... the walls... always whispering.
  - Listen carefully. The gate out of this dungeon is sealed.
  - 'It opens only for the three gems: the Ruby, the Emerald, and the Sapphire.'
  - Find them, and the way out may open for us yet.
  - Or stay here and let the dark chew through your mind. Your choice.
  inProgressLines:
  - Not yet... I can see it in your hands. They are still incomplete.
  - 'Bring me all three gems: Ruby, Emerald, and Sapphire.'
  - The gate will not answer to anything less.
  readyToCompleteLines:
  - Ah... yes. I can feel them. The three stones are finally together.
  - Ruby. Emerald. Sapphire. At last.
  - Good. Good... now the seal may break.
  - Go. Before this place changes its mind.
  completedLines:
  - Then go.
  - Do not look back, no matter what calls your name.
  vendor: {fileID: 0}
  vendorUI: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 0}
  questManager: {fileID: 0}
